⚡️🇲🇻 The Maldives have imposed an absolute ban on all israeli passport holders from entering the country.

Previously, proposals sought to only ban israelis until the genocide was halted but President Muizzu has now stated "israelis are not permitted to enter under any circumstances".

@medmannews

⚡🇮🇹New wave of fake bomb threats in Italian schools: an email signed by Mikhail Andropov, this time coming from a domain belonging to the Philippine Ministry of Education, threatens attacks at schools and even at Palazzo Chigi, demanding the resignation of Giorgia Meloni.

 The message caused evacuations and the intervention of law enforcement in several cities, particularly in Sicily and Emilia-Romagna.

